  "body": "Our vendors have relocated overseas, leaving this exceptional home vacant and ready for its next owners. With clear instructions to sell! This must be SOLD! \r\n\r\nOutstanding opportunity to secure a quality home in one of Orewa's most sought-after locations.\r\n\r\nThis is more than just a home, it is a lifestyle. Positioned to capture beautiful sea views, this thoughtfully designed 223sqm residence offers generous proportions, quality finishes and effortless family living. Built in 2007 with no expense spared and lovingly maintained by just two owners since new, this is a home where craftsmanship and attention to detail are evident throughout.\r\n\r\nDesigned for modern living, the heart of the home is the impressive kitchen, complete with quality finishes, ample storage and a butler's pantry. The open-plan kitchen, dining and living areas flow seamlessly to the outdoor entertaining spaces, creating the perfect setting for family gatherings or hosting friends. Large windows flood the home with natural light while framing the stunning sea views and enhancing the sense of space.\r\n\r\nOffering spacious bedrooms, stylish bathrooms and multiple indoor-outdoor living areas, this home has been thoughtfully designed with growing families in mind. The expansive floor plan provides flexibility for everyday living, while the outdoor spaces offer plenty of room to relax, entertain and enjoy the peaceful coastal surroundings.\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n\r\nElevated position with stunning sea views.\r\nSpacious 223sqm home designed for comfortable family living.\r\nBuilt in 2007 with quality craftsmanship and premium finishes.\r\nDesigner kitchen with ample storage and a butler's pantry.\r\nLight-filled open-plan living and dining with seamless indoor-outdoor flow.\r\nGenerous bedrooms and well-appointed bathrooms.\r\nMultiple outdoor entertaining areas.\r\nPeaceful location in sought-after Orewa.\r\n\r\nOur vendors have already made their move overseas, and with the home now vacant, it must be sold. Don't miss this rare opportunity - contact Ethan today to arrange your private viewing.",
